\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 fol. 13r\endash 201v: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20\chcbpat17 Bastarda}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  1. H\u228 \'e4lfte 15. Jh., B\u246 \'f6hmen (?).
