\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 98va-vb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Bernardus de Gordonio}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nota de cautelis necessariis medico ad urinas}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 [am oberen Blattrand vom Schreiber: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Cautele circa vrinas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ]. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item nota circa cautelas urinarum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 , tu medice, primo pete cuius sit urina. Si portans dicit, quod sit mulieris, dic quod habet magnam replectionem stomachi ... - ... pro quartana yems\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [f\u252 \'fcr: hiemale] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 pro catharro etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thorndike/Kibre, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Sp. 1109.3 (hier Zuweisung an Bernardus de Gordonio)\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 Auch in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Dillingen, Studienbibliothek, XV 128 I}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Konstanz 1416), 69r-71v; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Oxford, Bodleian Library, Canon. misc. 455}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (S.C. 19931) (15. Jh.), 237r-238va, vgl. https://www.mirabileweb.it/title/nota-de-cautelis-necessariis-medico-ad-urinas-title/27280. Vgl. Luke E. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Demaitre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Doctor Bernard de Gordon: professor and practitioner, Toronto 1980, S. 174, Nr. 9.}

